\n  .qr-placeholder {\n    width: 100px;\n    height: 100px;\n    background-color: #e6f7d4;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #6a9b36;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <h1>Natural plant growth and development achieved in the IPK<br>PhenoSphere by dynamic environment simulation</h1>\n  <h2>(作者个人信息区)</h2>\n  <div class=\"logo-area\">\n    YuanBao<br>\n    University<br>\n    Zhumi\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <!-- Left Column -->\n  <div class=\"column\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">INTRODUCTION</div>\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <p>Plant phenotypes are influenced by the constraints and dynamics of their interacting environment. The PhenoSphere at IPK in Germany successfully simulates field-like conditions, allowing analysis of plant growth performance under diverse weather scenarios.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">RESULTS</div>\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <p>Fig. 1: The experimental sites at the IPK Gatersleben.</p>\n      <div class=\"image-grid\">\n        <div class=\"image-placeholder\" style=\"height: 150px;\">[Image: a]</div>\n        <div class=\"image-placeholder\" style=\"height: 150px;\">[Image: b]</div>\n        <div class=\"image-placeholder\" style=\"height: 150px;\">[Image: d]</div>\n        <div class=\"image-placeholder\" style=\"height: 150px;\">[Image: c]</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"fig-caption\">a The PhenoSphere as seen from the outside. View into compartment 1 of the PhenoSphere early (b) and late (c) in the growth period. d The field 2016 at the IPK field site.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">CONCLUSION</div>\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <p>The controlled environmental conditions are indeed spatially highly homogeneous across the cultivation areas of the PhenoSphere.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Right Column -->\n  <div class=\"column\">\n    <div class=\"section-title\">METHODS</div>\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <p>Plant phenotypes are influenced by the constraints and dynamics of their interacting environment. The PhenoSphere at IPK in Germany successfully simulates field-like conditions, allowing analysis of plant growth performance under diverse weather scenarios.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\" style=\"background-color: #f4f0ef;\">\n      <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n        <div style=\"flex: 1;\">\n          <p>Fig. 2: Plant heights and growth speeds over time observed in seven field and indoor environments.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"image-placeholder\" style=\"width: 50%; height: 150px;\">\n          [Chart: Fig. 2]\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n        <p>Fig. 3: Developmental stage progression and leaf maturation rates over time observed in seven field and indoor environments.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"image-placeholder\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 200px;\">\n        [Charts: Fig. 3]\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section-title\">CONTACT</div>\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"contact-info\">\n        Whatsapp: 861356855××××<br>\n        Email: ××××0825@gmail.com\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"footer-graphics\">\n        <div class=\"image-placeholder\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 80px; background: transparent; border: none; color: #ccc;\">\n          [Graphics/Logos]\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"qr-placeholder\">\n          Your<br>QR code\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
